    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Blinding Aura"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, evocation, incapacitation, light, occult, visual)\n\n60 feet. The sunburst corpse sheds bright light. Any creature that starts its turn in the emanation must succeed at a DC 31 Fortitude save.\n\nIf it fails, it's blinded for 1 minute, and if it critically fails, it's blinded permanently. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune to this effect for 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "8979fc05-f4e7-4acc-aba3-91eba4e1a6a8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:41.569744"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Darkness Vulnerability"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A sunburst corpse is sickened 1 while in areas of magical darkness. If the level of the magical darkness effect is at least half of the sunburst corpse's level (a 7th-level effect against most sunburst corpses), the sunburst corpse is also slowed 1 while in the area."
            },
            "id": "25f16730-8895-49e5-9380-c1793a662106",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:41.569744"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Light Camouflage"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The sunburst corpse is concealed in areas of natural bright light, such as due to sunlight or torches, even to creatures that can see clearly in bright light. Magical bright light and light from the sunburst corpse's blinding aura don't conceal the sunburst corpse."
            },
            "id": "0ce6aa15-c8ac-495b-ad63-24dbe2c4e5e9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:41.569744"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Residual Light"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(evocation, light, occult)\n\nWhen a sunburst corpse Strikes or Grapples a creature, some of the corpse's light clings to the creature for a moment. The creature must attempt a DC 34 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature is dazzled until the end of its next turn. On a critical failure, the creature is dazzled for 1 minute. A dazzled creature can use an Interact action to wick off the light and remove the dazzled condition."
            },
            "id": "6aa954b2-428d-443a-9026-59a8a108454e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:41.569744"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
